@startuml

title PENA-Agent — Feedback and Learning Loop

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #444444
  LifeLineBorderColor #2F5597
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FBFF
  ParticipantBorderColor #2F5597
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FBFF
}

actor User
actor "Developer / Architect" as Dev

participant "PENA Runtime" as Runtime
participant "Observability Engine" as OBS
participant "Review / Validate" as Review
participant "Learning Extractor" as Learn
participant "Repository\nKnowledge Base" as KB
participant "Specs / UML" as Specs
participant "Next Iteration" as Next

User -> Runtime : Use digest\nprovide feedback
Runtime -> OBS : Emit runtime events\noutputs\nquality signals

Dev -> OBS : Inspect reports\nreview behavior
OBS -> Review : Provide evidence\nlogs\nmetrics\nAI behavior traces

Review -> Learn : Identify lessons\npatterns\nrisks\ncorrections
Learn -> KB : Store learning artifact

KB -> Specs : Update semantic context\nconstraints\nmodels
Specs -> Next : Guide next build / refinement
Next -> Runtime : Improved behavior

note over OBS,Review
Observability is not only production monitoring.
It also observes AI behavior, context quality,
spec quality, and engineering workflow.
end note

note over KB,Specs
Learning becomes persistent context.
The repository accumulates organizational memory.
end note

@enduml
